[background arg="res://img/point_and_click/backgrounds/Game Jam 2026 Blacksmith Background 1.png" fade="0.0"]
join Blacksmith center [mirrored="true"]
label blacksmith_greeting
Blacksmith: "How can I help you?"
- "I'd like to buy a sword." | [if {sword} == false]
	Blacksmith: "That'll be 6 Gold"
	- Purchase [you will have the sword upgrade]
		set {sword} = true
		jump blacksmith_greeting
		You now have the sword upgrade.
	- "I don't have that much money."
		jump blacksmith_greeting
- "The goblins are attacking!" | [if {blacksmith_recruited} == false]
	He looks out at the window at the peaceful town square, then back at you.
	Blacksmith: "You sure about that?"
	Doomsayer: "They're going to attack at sundown.\
	Will you help me defend the town from the church?"
	Blacksmith: "I have a lot of tools to finish repairing before tomorrow."
	Doomsayer: "There might not be a tomorrow."
	Blacksmith: "How about this..."
	Blacksmith: "If you can help me clear some orders off my plate, I'll be there tonight at the church."
	Blacksmith: "What do you say?"
	- "Yes" [You will lose 2 hours]
		set {blacksmith_recruited} = true
		You spend 2 hours toiling over the forge.
		By the end of it, the blacksmith's pile of repairs is looking considerably smaller.
		He thanks you and promises to show up at the church tonight.
		jump blacksmith_greeting
	- "No"
		jump blacksmith_greeting

- Return to the square
	leave Blacksmith
	jump village/square